<title>FRANCE: Remy Cointreau H1 sales up four percent.</title>
<headline>Remy Cointreau H1 sales up four percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 3,067    vs    2,941</p>
<p>    - Cognac					   941    vs	961</p>
<p>    - Liquors, wines and spirits	     1,001    vs	963</p>
<p>    - Champagne					343    vs	342</p>
<p>    - Partner brands				 782    vs	675</p>
<p>NOTE - Remy-Cointreau gave the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
